## Context

In `slides/manuscript/main.md`, sections are physically ordered as:
§1 Introduction, Related Work (unnumbered), §4 Experiment 1, §2 Quality bar, §3 AI landscape, §5 Experiment 2, §6 Fusion, §7 Discussion, §8 Conclusion.

The intro roadmap (§1, now fixed) assumes §2 precedes §4, but a reader encounters §4 before §2 and §3. This is a structural decision for the author: either reorder physical sections to match their numbers (§1→§2→§3→§4→§5...) or keep the current "results first" talk-style order and make the intro roadmap reflect it explicitly.

